
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Creative Academy - CSS Effects</title>

<style>
* {
    box-sizing: border-box;
}

body {
    margin: 0;
    font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
    color: #1e293b;
    background: #f8fafc;
}

header {
    background: #0f172a;
    color: white;
    padding: 18px 6%;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 15px;
}

.logo {
    font-size: 25px;
    font-weight: bold;
}

.logo span {
    color: #38bdf8;
}

header small {
    color: #cbd5e1;
}

nav {
    background: #1d4ed8;
    padding: 14px 6%;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 22px;
}

nav a {
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;

    /* TRANSITION PROPERTY */
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
}

nav a:hover {
    color: #fde68a;
}

.hero {
    padding: 55px 6%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    background: linear-gradient(120deg, #dbeafe, #eff6ff);
}

.hero-content {
    flex: 1;
}

.hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 46px);
    margin: 0 0 15px;
}

.hero p {
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: #475569;
}

.btn {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #2563eb;
    color: white;
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: 10px;

    /* TRANSITION PROPERTY */
    transition: background-color 0.3s ease,
                transform 0.3s ease;
}

.btn:hover {
    background: #1e40af;

    /* TRANSFORM PROPERTY */
    transform: translateY(-4px);
}

.hero-card {
    flex: 0 1 300px;
    min-height: 200px;
    padding: 25px;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #2563eb;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;

    /* TRANSITION PROPERTY */
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

.hero-card:hover {
    /* TRANSFORM PROPERTY */
    transform: rotate(2deg) scale(1.04);
}

.property-label {
    display: block;
    width: fit-content;
    max-width: 100%;
    background: #fff7ed;
    color: #9a3412;
    border: 1px solid #fed7aa;
    padding: 7px 9px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font: 12px/1.5 monospace;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
}

.section {
    padding: 35px 6%;
}

.section h2 {
    margin-top: 0;
    font-size: 27px;
}

.section-intro {
    color: #64748b;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.course-grid {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 22px;
    margin-top: 22px;
}

.course {
    flex: 1 1 230px;
    min-width: 0;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 22px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.05);

    /* TRANSITION PROPERTY */
    transition: transform 0.35s ease,
                box-shadow 0.35s ease;
}

.course:hover {
    /* TRANSFORM PROPERTY */
    transform: translateY(-8px) scale(1.02);

    box-shadow: 0 12px 25px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.15);
}

.course-icon {
    width: 65px;
    height: 65px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: #dbeafe;
    color: #1d4ed8;
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
}

.course:nth-child(2) .course-icon {
    background: #d1fae5;
    color: #047857;
}

.course:nth-child(3) .course-icon {
    background: #f3e8ff;
    color: #7e22ce;
}

.course h3 {
    margin: 0 0 10px;
}

.course p {
    color: #64748b;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 14px;
}

.course a {
    color: #2563eb;
    font-weight: bold;
    text-decoration: none;
}

.course a:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
}

.layout {
    padding: 0 6% 40px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 22px;
}

.main-content {
    flex: 2;
    min-width: 0;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 22px;
}

.sidebar {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    background: white;
    border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 22px;
}

.lesson {
    padding: 14px;
    margin: 12px 0;
    background: #f1f5f9;
    border-radius: 5px;
    border-left: 4px solid #2563eb;
}

.lesson p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: #64748b;
    font-size: 14px;
}

/* OVERFLOW PROPERTY */
.announcements {
    height: 160px;
    overflow-y: auto;
    overflow-x: hidden;
    background: #eff6ff;
    border: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 6px;
}

.announcement {
    padding: 10px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #bfdbfe;
    line-height: 1.5;
}

.announcement:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
}

.notice {
    margin-top: 15px;
    padding: 12px;
    border-radius: 5px;
    background: #fef3c7;

    /* OVERFLOW PROPERTY */
    overflow: hidden;
}

.notice p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
}

.gallery {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-top: 20px;
}

.gallery-item {
    flex: 1 1 180px;
    height: 130px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: #0f766e;
    color: white;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    font-weight: bold;

    /* TRANSITION PROPERTY */
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
}

.gallery-item:nth-child(2) {
    background: #7c3aed;
}

.gallery-item:nth-child(3) {
    background: #c2410c;
}

.gallery-item:hover {
    /* TRANSFORM PROPERTY */
    transform: rotate(-3deg) scale(1.06);
}

footer {
    padding: 25px 6%;
    background: #020617;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    text-align: center;
}

footer p {
    margin: 7px 0;
    font-size: 14px;
}

/* RESPONSIVE DESIGN */
@media (max-width: 700px) {
    header {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .hero {
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: stretch;
    }

    .hero-card {
        flex-basis: auto;
    }

    .layout {
        flex-direction: column;
    }

    .main-content,
    .sidebar {
        width: 100%;
    }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <div>
        <div class="logo">Creative<span>Academy</span></div>
        <small>Learn • Practice • Create</small>
        <span class="property-label">
            Properties: display: flex; justify-content; align-items; gap
        </span>
    </div>
    <div>Student Learning Portal</div>
</header>

<nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#courses">Courses</a>
    <a href="#lessons">Lessons</a>
    <a href="#gallery">Gallery</a>
    <span class="property-label">
        Properties: display: flex; flex-wrap; gap; transition
    </span>
</nav>

<section class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <h1>Build Skills for Your Future</h1>
        <p>
            Learn web development with simple lessons, practical examples
            and creative projects. Start with the basics and keep improving.
        </p>
        <a class="btn" href="#courses">Explore Courses</a>

        <span class="property-label">
            Properties: transition; transform: translateY()
        </span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-card">
        <h2>Learn CSS Effects</h2>
        <p>Move, rotate, resize and smoothly animate elements.</p>

        <span class="property-label">
            Properties: transform: rotate(); scale(); transition
        </span>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="section" id="courses">
    <h2>Our Popular Courses</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
        Hover over a course card to see the transition and transform effects.
    </p>

    <div class="course-grid">
        <article class="course">
            <div class="course-icon">HTML</div>
            <h3>HTML Basics</h3>
            <p>Learn headings, paragraphs, links, images and page structure.</p>
            <a href="#lessons">Explore course →</a>

            <span class="property-label">
                Properties: transition; transform: translateY(); scale()
            </span>
        </article>

        <article class="course">
            <div class="course-icon">CSS</div>
            <h3>CSS Styling</h3>
            <p>Learn colors, spacing, borders, layouts and visual effects.</p>
            <a href="#lessons">Explore course →</a>

            <span class="property-label">
                Properties: transition; transform; box-shadow
            </span>
        </article>

        <article class="course">
            <div class="course-icon">WEB</div>
            <h3>Web Projects</h3>
            <p>Practice your skills by building simple and useful websites.</p>
            <a href="#gallery">Explore projects →</a>

            <span class="property-label">
                Properties: flex; transition; transform
            </span>
        </article>
    </div>
</section>

<section class="layout" id="lessons">
    <main class="main-content">
        <h2>Latest Lessons</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
            Follow these lessons to improve your web development skills.
        </p>

        <div class="lesson">
            <strong>Lesson 01 — CSS Overflow</strong>
            <p>Control extra content with hidden, scroll and auto.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="lesson">
            <strong>Lesson 02 — CSS Transform</strong>
            <p>Move, rotate, enlarge and tilt website elements.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="lesson">
            <strong>Lesson 03 — CSS Transition</strong>
            <p>Create smooth changes when a user hovers over an element.</p>
        </div>

        <span class="property-label">
            Properties: overflow; transform; transition
        </span>
    </main>

    <aside class="sidebar">
        <h2>Announcements</h2>
        <p class="section-intro">
            Scroll inside this box to read all announcements.
        </p>

        <div class="announcements">
            <div class="announcement">
                <strong>New Course</strong><br>
                CSS effects practice is now available.
            </div>

            <div class="announcement">
                <strong>Practice Task</strong><br>
                Apply a transform effect to a card.
            </div>

            <div class="announcement">
                <strong>Student Challenge</strong><br>
                Create a smooth hover button.
            </div>

            <div class="announcement">
                <strong>Reminder</strong><br>
                Revise overflow and scrolling.
            </div>

            <div class="announcement">
                <strong>Next Topic</strong><br>
                Continue with CSS animations.
            </div>
        </div>

        <span class="property-label">
            Properties: overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden
        </span>

        <div class="notice">
            <strong>Important Notice</strong>
            <p>
                Complete each lesson and test the examples in your browser.
            </p>

            <span class="property-label">
                Property: overflow: hidden
            </span>
        </div>
    </aside>
</section>

<section class="section" id="gallery">
    <h2>Creative Project Gallery</h2>
    <p class="section-intro">
        Hover over each block to see it rotate and enlarge smoothly.
    </p>

    <div class="gallery">
        <div class="gallery-item">
            Project One
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-item">
            Project Two
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-item">
            Project Three
        </div>
    </div>

    <span class="property-label">
        Properties: transition: transform; transform: rotate() scale()
    </span>
</section>

<footer>
    <strong>Creative Academy</strong>
    <p>Learn web development one step at a time.</p>
    <p>HTML + CSS Student Practice Project</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
